<h2>Who We Are</h2>

<p>
GoodLeaders is a leadership platform created to help people develop
leadership skills, character, integrity, communication and teamwork.
</p>

<p>
Our goal is to provide useful educational resources and a positive
environment where people can learn, grow and become better leaders.
</p>

